@title Moquette
@start title
@ui tube.js

[[title]]:
@class title-card
{{!--
    Moquette, by Alex Warren. An entry in IFComp 2013, written for Quest 5.5, and the reason
    Squiffy exists. This is the Squiffy version.

    This file is the title and the commute, up to the moment Zoran leaves his usual train.

    train.squiffy       riding a train from station to station, and what there is to know on the way
    platform.squiffy    waiting for trains, and changing lines
    carriage.squiffy    the other passengers
    thoughts.squiffy    what goes through Zoran's head as the morning goes on
    visions.squiffy     smoke, and clay
    heather.squiffy     Heather
